sentences.text:
11. Let the applicant-Pramod Kumar be released on bail in FIR No.47 of 2023, under Sections 406,
419, 420, 467, 468, 471, 120-B I.P.C., registered at Police Station Dewa, District Barabanki on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
12.

